  "body": "## Changelog\n* 83d29b663703d21c1fde38d058a139c7a2f41620 Add mouse support\n* a7aa734b174914162c446960969d4707249c2f0b Add page navigation keys to lists\n* f269a52fa246a2ee364c975af018e6dd916dfb6f Add stats test scaffolding\n* fd2ca64033a27bf3f5492294634b689125274780 Create ci.yaml\n* c6b6786ab049d5e531215e941f388a4a19bfea1a Fix branch ahead/behind counts\n* c2adcb782f5d0c120f0c2db69515f26649102dc2 Fix commits since latest tag count\n* dd8500e55de47ae10ddb3e69fca95089ad551da2 Fix lint issues\n* 5d35fd6cca1204a82b35c453bf44fb75ad75ea97 Fix shortcuts firing in file filter input\n* 819e188dfa40dd118f641d39aad2c887e16b2df8 Match Git's mailmap loading\n* 96847050048c9164abdf32065098cb71759f6180 Order commits like git log\n* 37991b40222a507d883c46003c206fb2675cafa7 Reuse loaded commits for file lists\n* 4af69a3d9115aeb170b89b3d16bc9cdc81501a83 Share commit loading between Init and refresh\n* 1d682d7efbb43e7d5846484143b9416a4aa30e16 Skip binary files in line counts\n* fdad8a67fd01a25c11cfbb4bb69c9af33938b09f Skip file lists for merge commits\n* c53044e6d6d0f6cc2447848b33f4b8311f369478 Skip rename detection in commitFiles\n* 08949b16d4064713759598c5ae9f90816a554503 Support linked worktrees\n* 0dca9291d3a8cf9155c7f58ed6d35bf9a9efe0c4 Tidy go.mod\n* 844b8ac4b20eadf923684888d2707f17e3c41cf0 Update PKGBUILD\n* 3a47baacdee6b48a412508e459d3bfe98eee9247 Update README.md\n* f8c16161dac534101bcc3ef2920234378837c0e9 Update ci.yaml\n* 88eb1a8b70a8f9d092a519326df14fb497118db7 Update dependencies\n* 8162e4422ae36c215e0dc753270957478e819a75 Update dependencies and Nix flake\n* ea244a5f724352e8f1782e1c8fadd0dac178fe48 Update to Go 1.27\n\n"
